[h1]Boss Physics[/h1]
[b]Walls stop boss attacks, and bosses break walls.[/b] Hiding behind a wall protects you, but only for a while.
Requires [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3558238376]Mod Settings Lib[/url]. Every player and the server need both.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Walls block direct fire[/b]: whitelisted boss projectiles stop at the first wall. Lobbed attacks (spider spit, eggs, boulders) still arc over.
[*][b]Projectiles break walls[/b]: each hit chips the wall, at most a quarter of its health, so a wall takes at least 4 hits. Broken walls drop their item.
[*][b]Explosions[/b] (Swamp Guardian's boulders, The Void's void rain) break objects where they land.
[*][b]Summons dig in[/b]: if they cannot reach you they walk around cover, break the door (5 hits), then walls.
[*][b]Tool tiers[/b]: each boss only breaks walls up to its progression tier.
[*][b]Safe places stay safe[/b]: no wall damage in settlements by default; boss arenas, dungeons and unbreakable objects are never damaged.
[/list]

[h2]Supported bosses[/h2]
Evils Protector, Queen Spider, Swamp Guardian, Ancient Vulture, Reaper, Cryo Queen, Pest Warden, Sage & Grit, Mother Slime, Night Swarm, Spider Empress, Sunlight Champion, Moonlight Dancer, Crystal Dragon, Mutant Hydra, Ascended Wizard, The Void. Every default passed an automated balance test (open field, closed box, half cover, box with a door).

[h2]Settings[/h2]
Settings > Mod settings > Boss Physics: switches and damage multipliers. Server settings, so they change from the main menu. Whitelists and tool tiers are in [i]cfg/mods/a632079.bossphysics.cfg[/i]; admins apply edits with [b]/bp reload[/b]. In multiplayer the server's settings apply to everyone.

[h2]Commands (admin)[/h2]
[b]/bp status[/b], [b]/bp reload[/b]; [b]/bp debug, /bp spawnboss, /bp autotest[/b] for testing.

[h2]Limits[/h2]
[list]
[*]Beams, charges and ground AoE still go through walls; they are not projectiles.
[*]Big bosses reach over walls in melee (vanilla behaviour).
[*]Summons keep pushing at walls they cannot break.
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]Boss Physics 物理化 Boss[/h1]
[b]墙能挡住 boss 的攻击，boss 也能把墙打穿。[/b]躲在墙后能保护你，但撑不了太久。
需要前置 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3558238376]Mod Settings Lib[/url]，服务器和所有玩家都要安装这两个 Mod。

[h2]功能[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]墙挡直射[/b]：列入白名单的 boss 弹体撞墙即停。抛物线攻击（蜘蛛吐液、蛋、巨石）照样飞过墙。
[*][b]弹体拆墙[/b]：每次命中削减墙的耐久，一发最多扣四分之一，所以至少 4 下才能打穿。被拆的墙照常掉落物品。
[*][b]爆炸拆墙[/b]：Swamp Guardian 的巨石、The Void 的虚空雨落地时破坏周围的物体。
[*][b]召唤物破墙[/b]：够不到你时先绕过掩体，被围住就先破门（5 下），再拆墙。
[*][b]工具等级[/b]：每个 boss 只能打坏不超过自己进度等级的墙。
[*][b]安全区域不受影响[/b]：定居点内默认不拆墙；boss 场地、地牢和不可破坏的物体始终打不坏。
[/list]

[h2]支持的 boss[/h2]
上面列出的 17 个 boss。默认设置都通过了自动平衡性测试（空地、封闭墙盒、半掩体、带门的墙盒）。

[h2]设置[/h2]
设置 → Mod 设置 → Boss Physics：各项开关和伤害倍率。它们是服务器设置，只能在主菜单修改。白名单和工具等级在 [i]cfg/mods/a632079.bossphysics.cfg[/i] 里，管理员改完后用 [b]/bp reload[/b] 生效。联机时以服务器的设置为准。

[h2]指令（管理员）[/h2]
[b]/bp status[/b]、[b]/bp reload[/b]；[b]/bp debug、/bp spawnboss、/bp autotest[/b] 用于测试。

[h2]限制[/h2]
[list]
[*]光束、冲锋和地面范围攻击仍会穿墙，它们不是弹体。
[*]大体型 boss 的近战能隔墙打到人（原版行为）。
[*]召唤物遇到打不动的墙会一直撞着它。
[/list]
